= Julio Álvarez del Vayo

Álvarez del Vayo is a journalist and diplomat of the party's left, the foremost champion of working-class unity with the <span style="color: #8a0303;">**PCE**</span> - though he insists any alliance be on equal terms, not a surrender to Moscow's line.

