title: Cooperation with the <span style="color: #8a0303;">**PCE**</span>
subtitle: Any alliance between the parties requires compromise from the <span style="color: #8a0303;">**PCE**</span> as well as the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>.
